        "jsCode": "// Note: for a real aggregation, you'd typically run this on a separate Cron,\n// reading all Feedback/Leads/Bookings rows fresh, rather than per-submission.\n// Shown here as a lightweight per-submission update for demo purposes.\n\nconst feedback = items.map(i => i.json);\nconst avgRating = feedback.reduce((sum, f) => sum + Number(f.rating || 0), 0) / (feedback.length || 1);\n\nreturn { json: { avg_rating: avgRating.toFixed(2), updated_at: new Date().toISOString() } };"
